{
  "doc": "Ch5 'Terraces of Ash' (M3-C05-02; docs/kb/story/beats/act1_ch05.md B01-B11; docs/kb/tech/chapter_flow.md 'Ch5'). Two greybox zones, played by ZoneStory. Entry: ch05/pemakar at Harbour (Ch4's Brightwater ferry hands off there; the location's own spawn is Harbour too, so Ch5 is reachable on its own). Pemakar, Lanternfall night: the ferry and Asha's first band (B01, the chapter becomes 5), the town's six barks (the ferryman's sets ch05_heard_straw_cape_tale, never in Kerrid's sight), Garo's side scene (B03), then the crown bell: the boats and Rhen's choice (B04: exactly one of three flags; 'Not yet' gives the key item pemakar_leaf_boat; Kell's wick is never touched), the weir and Kerrid (B05; he joins active), the inn gate (B06), and on to ch05/ashcrown at StairFoot. Ashcrown: the stair banters, the scripted slag tortoise pair (Kerrid's sundering blow lesson), random stair fights (the layout's encounters), the crown pavilion (B08's rite), the trial (Ch05AshcrownZone, AshcrownTrial; ashcrown.json), the optional quench charm, the Matron (B09) when the strike lands, Kahre (B10) on the return from the fight, and back to ch05/pemakar at FromAshcrown. Pemakar after (B11): the day variant, Kerrid at the inn gate, after-festival barks, the smith's fallback, and the harbour road at dawn. Exit: the dawn hands off to Ch6's ch06/brine_shoals at Entry (M3-C06-02).",
